---
description: When to follow a project procedure
alwaysApply: true
---

This project keeps tool-neutral procedures in `.agents/procedures/`.
Read the matching file and follow every step when its trigger fires.

| Trigger | Procedure |
|---|---|
| You gave a substantive technical answer | `save-knowledge.md` |
| A choice was made between real options | `write-adr.md` |
| The session is ending or the context is long | `session-handoff.md` |
| Something failed in a running environment | `incident-playbook.md` |
| You finished a code change | `pre-commit-review.md` |
| `docs/context/` still holds empty templates | `first-fill.md` |
